        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Morgan Paull, Hampton Fancher, David Peoples, Philip K. Dick, Ridley Scott\n- Works: Blade Runner, Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?\n- Roles: American actor, screenwriters\n\nFacts:\n- Philip K. Dick wrote the 1968 novel \"Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?\"\n- Hampton Fancher and David Peoples wrote the script for \"Blade Runner.\"\n- \"Blade Runner\" is a loose adaptation of Philip K. Dick's 1968 novel \"Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep?\"\n- Ridley Scott directed the film \"Blade Runner.\"\n- Morgan Paull was an American actor.\n- Morgan Paull played Dave Holden in Ridley Scott's film \"Blade Runner.\"\n- Morgan Paull was born on December 15, 1944, and died on July 17, 2012.",
